# SHA-256 of chopper v0.14.1's stdout for each command line, run from the
# repository root. Checked by tests/formats.rs: FASTQ in, FASTQ out must stay
# byte-identical to the release.
#
# <sha256>  <mode>  <arguments>
#   exact   output compared as is
#   sorted  output of a multi-threaded run, records sorted before hashing
#   stdin   test-data/test.fastq fed on stdin instead of -i
#
# Regenerate (only when a FASTQ output change is intended) with the released
# binary, e.g. for an `exact` line: chopper <arguments> | sha256sum
